  "details": "This requests to add the language tags a player has in their profile to the player (VRCPlayerAPI).\nThis will allow to localise worlds by iterating over the language tag array and provide language support accordingly in worlds.\nAs the language tags include sign language variations, it also allows to check whether sign language related world features should be enabled.\nLanguage tags are opt-in and accessible to every user already, unlike `CultureInfo.CurrentCulture`, which would invade privacy if exposed.",
